": 5, "quote": "Sometimes it's nice to know someone notices.", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Thanks for being here.", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But thanks for checking in. Sometimes it's nice to know someone notices.", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "Thanks for being there.", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not much changed, honestly. Just feeling the same, you know? Same old, same old.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Feels like I'm missing something, you know?", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, just going through the motions. Same friends, same routines. Feels like I'm missing something, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Yeah, I just wish things felt a bit more... I don't know, alive, maybe.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 71}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Thanks though.", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just same old, you know?", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 55}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "just feeling kinda alone on my birthday", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Yeah, it's just not the same as last year. No one called, no breakfast in bed. Feels kinda empty.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It’s just making me feel more alone.", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 128}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's just... same old, I guess. Noone really called or anything. You know, just feeling kinda alone on my birthday.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It's just... tough, you know? I mean, I expected maybe a message or something, you know? But it's been quiet.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 109}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's just... same old, I guess.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "But I know you're here, so thanks", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Makes me wonder if anyone cares.", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 66}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T225337Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T231246Z", "first_seen_session": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "last_session": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
